\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf9 \cb15 \strokec9 droob is a FAST and Efficient on-demand delivery app that connects you with nearby truck drivers and couriers instantly. We have signed hundreds of truck drivers across Kuwait, so you can get the truck you need, when you need it.\cb1 \
\
\cb15 Whether you need to deliver products to your customers, move a couch, deliver construction materials, or tow your car, our app connects you to professional qualified drivers, and companies seamlessly and easily.\cb1 \
\
\cb15 Transportation made Simple. Download droob now!\cb1 \
\
\cb15 droob helps small and Medium sized businesses (SMBs), contractors and consumers with on-demand, same-day, or next-day delivery & moving services.\cb1 \
\
\cb15 The droob app offers real-time tracking features so you know exactly where your delivery is and when it will reach your destination. Our transparent pricing system lets you know exactly how much your order will cost before you place an order. The e-wallet or cash on delivery options also provides you with more flexibility.\cb1 \
\
\cb15 We do all sorts of heavy & bulk deliveries including:\cb1 \
\cb15 \'95	Small, medium & bulk products\cb1 \
\cb15 \'95	Refrigerated products\cb1 \
\cb15 \'95	Construction materials\cb1 \
\cb15 \'95	Furniture\cb1 \
\cb15 \'95	Car & Boat towing\'85 etc\cb1 \
\
\
\cb15 Book your on-demand or scheduled deliveries in less than 1 minute!\cb1 \
\
\cb15 1. Open the droob app\cb1 \
\cb15 2. Select service type (Personal, company, construction, towing)\cb1 \
\cb15 3. Select vehicle type\cb1 \
\cb15 4. Set pick-up & drop-off locations\cb1 \
\cb15 5. Choose your preferred Time (immediate or scheduled)\cb1 \
\cb15 6. Choose payment method (E-wallet/cash/Knet/Credit Card)\cb1 \
\cb15 7. Match with driver and track your delivery in real-time\cb1 \
\
\cb15 With multi-stop deliveries & e-signature capabilities, droob is the ideal transportation solution for small and medium sized businesses (SMBs), contractors, and consumers that require innovative on-demand logistics solutions.\cb1 \
\
